{"query":"Lodha Altus, Borivali West  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus","title":"Lodha Altus - Properties in Borivali West - Blox.xyz","content":"The amenities are Chess and Carrom Room, Fitness Center, Gymnasium, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Pool, Library And Business Centre, Open Air Cafe, Open Lawn","score":0.8969848,"raw_content":null,"id":"55ac23-00"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/lodha-altus-facilities-borivali-west-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r431493","title":"Lodha Altus Amenities - Borivali West, Mumbai Facilities","content":"The amenity plan at Lodha Altus includes swimming pool, gym, landscaped gardens and children's play area. Each amenity is planned for daily use by residents.","score":0.8923472,"raw_content":null,"id":"07ac35-01"},{"url":"https://realtypromoo.com/projects/lodha-altus-borivali-west-mumbai","title":"Lodha Altus Borivali West Mumbai — Price & Review | RealtyPromoo","content":"## Amenities\n\nAmenities are spread across the podium and a dedicated wellness floor:\n\n Fitness & Sports: Fully-equipped gym (~2,500 sq.ft.), yoga and meditation deck, jogging track on podium, indoor games room (table tennis, carrom, chess)\n Water: Two pools — main swimming pool (~20m) and a separate kids' splash pool with shaded deck\n Kids: Outdoor play area with rubberised flooring, indoor kids' activity zone\n Social: Multipurpose banquet hall, co-working lounge with high-speed Wi-Fi, landscaped garden with seating pockets, library nook\n Security: 3-tier manned security, CCTV across common areas and lobbies, video door phone in every unit, biometric access at podium gates, fire detection and sprinkler system [...] ★★★★★  4.1\n\n## About Lodha Altus Borivali West Mumbai\n\nLodha Altus is a single-tower premium residential project by Lodha Group situated on LT Road, Borivali West — one of Mumbai's most established western suburbs. The project is developed on roughly 1.5 acres and offers a G+40 storey high-rise housing approximately 280 units in 1, 2 and 3 BHK configurations. What sets Altus apart in Borivali is the unusually large podium-level amenity deck for a plot this size, and direct walkability (under 8 minutes) to Borivali railway station — a rarity for new launches in this micro-market, where most fresh inventory has shifted further north toward Dahisar and Mira Road.\n\n## Key Highlights [...] Borivali West is a self-sufficient micro-market with established social infrastructure — schools, hospitals, two large malls and Sanjay Gandhi National Park all within a 10-minute radius. Lodha Altus sits on LT Road, the spine connecting SV Road and the Western Express Highway, giving residents flexibility on commute routes. The upcoming Metro Line 7 (Dahisar–Andheri East) and Line 2A station at Eksar Road are within 1.5 km, which will significantly cut down commute times to BKC and the airport once fully operational. Honest concerns: LT Road sees heavy peak-hour congestion, especially around Borivali station between 8–10 AM and 7–9 PM, and the area has historically faced waterlogging during heavy monsoon spells near Eksar and Chandavarkar Lane. Construction activity in the immediate","score":0.852752,"raw_content":null,"id":"5c7554-02"},{"url":"https://www.jllhomes.co.in/apartments-new/mumbai/lodha-altus-4-bhk-flat-borivali-west-1731-sqft","title":"Lodha Altus 4 BHK Flat Borivali West 1731 sqft properties | JLL Homes","content":"The Lodha Borivali project boasts world-class amenities, including state-of-the-art fitness centers, serene landscaped gardens, and exclusive recreational","score":0.8464638,"raw_content":null,"id":"87ba35-03"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/lodha-altus","title":"Lodha Altus Borivali West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","content":"This project offers 13+ amenities. Key external amenities include Amphitheater, Skating Rink, Senior Citizen Area, Multi Purpose Court, and","score":0.8335554,"raw_content":null,"id":"90c582-04"},{"url":"https://www.lodhagroup.com/projects/residential-property-in-borivali/lodha-altus","title":"Lodha Altus: 3 & 4 BHK Flats in Borivali with Deck | Lodha Borivali","content":"Lodha Altus, Borivali is not only a serene residential choice but also offers easy access to a host of essential amenities and vibrant local attractions. Whether you're looking for entertainment, healthcare, education or key city connections, this location provides a well-rounded lifestyle with numerous nearby options.\n\n Entertainment: Enjoy nearby Carnival Cinema (10 minutes) and MCA Kandivali and Poinsur Gymkhana (5 minutes).\n Healthcare: Shatabdi Hospital is 5 minutes away and Bhagwati Hospital is 15 minutes from the property.\n Education: Don Bosco High School (10 minutes) and Swami Vivekananda International School (15 minutes) are close by.\n Places of Worship: Sai Baba Mandir is adjacent (2 minutes) and Geetanjali Shankheswar Parshvanath Jain Derasar is 5 minutes away.\n\nView More;) [...] ## Residences That Are Spacious\n\nTowering above the rest, these exclusive residences at Lodha Altus are designed with generous proportions and open-air decks that extend your living spaces outdoors. Wake up to views of the Sanjay Gandhi National Park and the Global Pagoda.\n\n## Life at Lodha Altus\n\nLodha Altus is replete with lavish five-star amenities within expansive confines to indulge your every whim and fancy. Take a refreshing swim in the resort-style pool, enjoy a game at the outdoor sports court, or begin your day with a jog along the walking trail. For moments of quiet reflection, the serene Ganesha shrine offers a space to pause and reconnect.\n\nStatus: Under Construction\n\n Library\n\n  Library\n Gym\n\n  Gym\n Ganesha Temple\n\n  Ganesha Temple\n Community Plaza [...] ### Where is Lodha Altus, Borivali West Located?\n\nLodha Altus, Borivali West is located in Saibaba Nagar, a desirable residential area due to its strategic and convenient position. It is situated near major roads, including the Western Express Highway, S.V. Road and Linking Road, which facilitates easy travel across Mumbai.\n\n### How will Lodha transform the lifestyle in Borivali?\n\nLodha Altus, Borivali West brings a blend of timeless art deco architecture and elegant sophistication. With world-class amenities, Lodha Altus creates unparalleled experiences.\n\n  \n\nLodha Altus brings spacious and luxury 4BHK residences and select penthouses to Borivali.\n\n### How well is Lodha Altus, Borivali West connected to other parts of the city?","score":0.8170061,"raw_content":null,"id":"ab5d82-05"},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/lodha-group/lodha-altus-120975","title":"Lodha Altus, Borivali West, Mumbai | 3 & 4 BHK Luxury Apartments | Houssed","content":"Towers / Floors\n\n2 Towers  / 40 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Lodha Altus Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Flat in Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 811753\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1086 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4.03 Cr\n\n3.5 BHK Flat in Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 811754\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1313 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4.76 Cr\n\n4 BHK Flat in Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 811755\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1713 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n6.25 Cr\n\nFloor Plan of Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 154957\nMaster Plan of Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 154958\n\n## Key Features of Lodha Altus Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n## Amenities Lodha Altus Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n### Convenience\n\n### Safety\n\n### Sports\n\n### Leisure\n\n### Environment [...] Houssed\nwhatsapp\nProject Image of Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 154948\nProject Image of Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 154949\nAmenities of Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 154950\nAmenities of Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 154951\nAmenities of Lodha Altus in Borivali West, Mumbai - 